            </note>
            <note corresp="#d65-f2" n="2" xml:id="d65-f2-content">
                <p>August 9.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d65-f3" n="3" xml:id="d65-f3-content">
                <p>Reference is to the fact that oil pipelines from both Iraq and Saudi Arabia
                    passed through Syria.</p>
